From 28c38e68521d8786d635bcd03c79e594d8d77079 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 05:35:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Harden Amrod client (204 window, retry, stale fallback);
 real orders, quotes and checkout; branding UI; remove mock data

- amrod: 00:00-01:00 GMT+2 204 handling, timeout + retry on ECONNRESET/5xx, stale-on-error, shared cache on globalThis
- catalogue: never replace data with an empty/204 result, skip refresh in the window, real category names from Amrod paths
- checkout/quotes/orders: server-side repricing + stock checks, JSON file store, API routes
- product page: Unbranded/Branded, position and artwork notes; branded items go via quote
- checkout: fix hooks-order bug, show server validation errors
- remove mock products/orders/quotes; fix .gitignore merge markers; add .env.example
